A quad effect can be configured under the '''Quad''' tab in the Node Info window. The specific settings are described in the following table.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
{| {{Table}}&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablehead|Setting|Description}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{HeadingSetting|'''Quad&amp;amp;nbsp;Settings'''|}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablerow|'''Quad&amp;amp;nbsp;color'''|The color of the quad effect.}}&lt;br /&gt;
